[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Switching a system on or off changes what is shown and never the payload

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-A-TOGGLE-NEVER-CHANGES-THE-PAYLOAD
TITLE: Switching a system on or off changes what is shown and never the payload
DEPTH: interface-settled
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The system switches select client-side over the nodes, edges and backlinks the payload already holds; counts, strips, indexes and figures recompute from that selection; the selection rides in the page's address so a link carries it. No switch causes a re-render or a second payload.
<<<
